WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,320 --> 00:00:02,200
Qi Ye, Uncle Huang, Uncle Liu

2
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:03,760
I want a loan to buy a boat

3
00:00:03,880 --> 00:00:06,360
Please three of you, please keep it a secret and don’t tell anyone else.

4
00:00:06,520 --> 00:00:08,080
Including my mother and my three ex-wives

5
00:00:08,640 --> 00:00:11,080
Your mother, they don’t know yet, don’t they?

6
00:00:11,360 --> 00:00:12,400
Ladies are so timid

7
00:00:12,640 --> 00:00:16,650
I want to wait until the matter is done and then tell them that's not possible, Mr. Qi.

8
00:00:16,970 --> 00:00:18,970
Just for those sea ropes I treated you to before

9
00:00:19,130 --> 00:00:23,830
You have to help me keep it a secret. Your boy is in a good home.

10
00:00:24,270 --> 00:00:25,750
I never thought I was wise

11
00:00:25,990 --> 00:00:28,670
In the end, this guy used a few sea ropes to control him.

12
00:00:35,820 --> 00:00:37,180
The biggest task given by above this year

13
00:00:37,300 --> 00:00:38,900
It means issuing Wuxi loans to farmers.

14
00:00:39,060 --> 00:00:40,780
Seeing that one third of the year has passed

15
00:00:40,940 --> 00:00:41,900
The entire credit union

16
00:00:41,900 --> 00:00:43,300
I go to various towns every day

17
00:00:43,460 --> 00:00:45,700
But the effect was basically zero in the previous quarter

18
00:00:45,860 --> 00:00:46,940
Huanghai County places completion rate

19
00:00:46,940 --> 00:00:48,180
It is also the first in the city to build offices.

20
00:00:48,340 --> 00:00:49,580
How can I explain it to the superiors?

21
00:00:51,940 --> 00:00:55,820
Director, something big happened, what big thing happened?

22
00:00:56,180 --> 00:00:58,420
Someone from above is coming again to check the progress of our loan, isn't it?

23
00:00:58,740 --> 00:01:01,940
Someone came to my door to apply for a loan. Is this true or false?

24
00:01:02,380 --> 00:01:04,060
Someone actually comes to your door to apply for a loan

25
00:01:04,300 --> 00:01:05,460
If something goes wrong, there will be a backbone

26
00:01:05,620 --> 00:01:07,460
Isn't it some local gangster trying to swindle money?

27
00:01:07,580 --> 00:01:08,620
Have you told the other party

28
00:01:08,780 --> 00:01:10,220
This loan has to be repaid

29
00:01:10,460 --> 00:01:11,580
This is not pie in the sky

30
00:01:11,700 --> 00:01:13,220
If you don't make it, you'll go to jail.

31
00:01:13,660 --> 00:01:15,500
What he holds in his hand is the promotional leaflet of our credit union.

32
00:01:15,860 --> 00:01:17,500
There is also a letter of introduction from the Houhai Village branch.

33
00:01:17,820 --> 00:01:21,220
I've checked that the big red car on the letter of introduction is stamped with a seal, not a carrot car.

34
00:01:22,820 --> 00:01:23,860
How old does that person look?

35
00:01:24,100 --> 00:01:25,180
Looks to be in his twenties

36
00:01:25,540 --> 00:01:29,460
Like a serious person takes me there

37
00:01:29,740 --> 00:01:30,740
I want to receive it personally
